{"unit_id":"96d8c4efae5e85b2c822","title":"提案八                                         提案人︰審查組","kind":"proposal","blocks":[{"page":6,"block_id":"MEET-1a7882ce610ea67aee35-p6-b9","raw_text":"提案八                                         提案人︰審查組 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":53,"bbox":[42.599998474121094,255.033935546875,546.6600341796875,269.07391357421875]},{"page":6,"block_id":"MEET-1a7882ce610ea67aee35-p6-b10","raw_text":"案由：追認增列糖尿病用藥GLP-1-insulin 複方針劑checklist。  \n","start_char":0,"end_char":43,"bbox":[42.599998474121094,279.344970703125,489.4200134277344,294.344970703125]},{"page":6,"block_id":"MEET-1a7882ce610ea67aee35-p6-b11","raw_text":"說明： \n","start_char":0,"end_char":5,"bbox":[42.599998474121094,305.1939697265625,91.61363983154297,319.23394775390625]},{"page":6,"block_id":"MEET-1a7882ce610ea67aee35-p6-b12","raw_text":"一、 糖尿病用藥含lixisenatide 及insulin glargine 之複方製劑(Soliqua)已於\n","start_char":0,"end_char":57,"bbox":[57.594722747802734,326.8015441894531,552.9525756835938,345.96612548828125]},{"page":6,"block_id":"MEET-1a7882ce610ea67aee35-p6-b13","raw_text":"110/7/1 修正公告。 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":15,"bbox":[93.56521606445312,355.1202392578125,223.1123046875,369.16021728515625]},{"page":6,"block_id":"MEET-1a7882ce610ea67aee35-p6-b14","raw_text":"二、 限用於已接受過最大耐受劑量Metformin 及/或 Sulfonylurea 類藥物，且併\n","start_char":0,"end_char":50,"bbox":[57.566650390625,376.8401184082031,552.9035034179688,396.00469970703125]},{"page":6,"block_id":"MEET-1a7882ce610ea67aee35-p6-b15","raw_text":"用下列藥品之一持續六個月之後，HBA1c 仍高於8.0%以上之第二型糖尿病成\n","start_char":0,"end_char":39,"bbox":[93.55117797851562,405.1588134765625,552.7981567382812,419.19879150390625]},{"page":6,"block_id":"MEET-1a7882ce610ea67aee35-p6-b16","raw_text":"人病人(110/7/1): \n","start_char":0,"end_char":15,"bbox":[93.55117797851562,430.1219482421875,212.55137634277344,444.16192626953125]},{"page":6,"block_id":"MEET-1a7882ce610ea67aee35-p6-b17","raw_text":"(1)SGLT-2 抑制劑 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":15,"bbox":[90.54661560058594,455.1973876953125,206.05369567871094,469.23736572265625]},{"page":6,"block_id":"MEET-1a7882ce610ea67aee35-p6-b18","raw_text":"(2)DPP-4 抑制劑 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":14,"bbox":[90.56065368652344,480.1605224609375,199.10389709472656,494.20050048828125]},{"page":6,"block_id":"MEET-1a7882ce610ea67aee35-p6-b19","raw_text":"(3)SGLT-2 抑制劑合併 DPP-4 抑制劑複方藥品 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":31,"bbox":[90.56065368652344,505.1236572265625,377.6645812988281,519.1636352539062]},{"page":6,"block_id":"MEET-1a7882ce610ea67aee35-p6-b20","raw_text":"       (4)Insulin(每日劑量小於60 單位) \n","start_char":0,"end_char":32,"bbox":[42.557861328125,530.1990966796875,315.6218566894531,544.2390747070312]},{"page":6,"block_id":"MEET-1a7882ce610ea67aee35-p6-b21","raw_text":"三、本藥品不得與DPP-4 抑制劑、SGLT-2 抑制劑併用。 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":33,"bbox":[56.59791564941406,555.1622314453125,403.2314758300781,569.2022094726562]},{"page":6,"block_id":"MEET-1a7882ce610ea67aee35-p6-b22","raw_text":"辦法：增列糖尿病用藥GLP-1-insulin 複方針劑checklist 供會員參考，如附件四。 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":51,"bbox":[42.57196044921875,580.1253662109375,559.86181640625,594.1653442382812]},{"page":6,"block_id":"MEET-1a7882ce610ea67aee35-p6-b23","raw_text":"決議： 照案通過。 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":11,"bbox":[42.599998474121094,604.4249877929688,177.66000366210938,619.4249877929688]}],"source_quality":[]}